    "title": "Job Opening Logistics Manager at Dunzo Logistics",
    "description": "Dunzo Logistics is actively seeking a talented and motivated Logistics Manager to join our dynamic team in Srinagar. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Dunzo Logistics:\nDunzo Logistics is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Prepare MIS reports on delivery performance and SLA adherence\n• Ensure compliance with transportation regulations and safety standards\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in KPI Monitoring\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in Last Mile Delivery\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Srinagar, Jammu & Kashmir, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dunzo Logistics!",
